      "evidence_quote": "17 astrocytoma surgical specimens... Diffuse, low grade astrocytoma (three cases)... intermediate grade (one case)",
      "reason": "The statement accurately reports the sample sizes and correctly notes that the passage does not report statistical testing or replication.",
      "label": "supported"
    },
